<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia wage bill to rise by A$3 bln/yr - industry.</title>
<headline>Australia wage bill to rise by A$3 bln/yr - industry.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A major Australian industry group said on Tuesday that the national wage decision, issued earlier, would add more than A$3 billion to the country's annual wage costs.</p>
</text>
